        }
      ],
      "content": "1.  839                                                    Ashlyns Hall SP 90 NE 7/43                  29.7.50. II*                               GV 2. Dignified early C19 house.  Stucco, Welsh slate roof+  2 storeys and attics, roughly rectangular plan.  South west garden front has central. 3 storeyed semi-circular bow with let floor cast iron verandah  South east garden front has central pediment*  Sash windows, glazing bars only to 1st floor. North east wing added since 1930.  Interior circular entrance hall and room above, fine staircase hall,  Set in small landscaped park with fine cedars. Included for group value. Listing NGR: SP9915606690"
    }
